cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "ODPGen: Generating Ontology Design Patterns with Large Language Models"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and evaluation artefacts accompanying the study "Generating
  Ontology Design Patterns with LLMs: An Empirical Evaluation on Recently
  Published Patterns": ODP generation with open and proprietary LLMs under five
  prompting configurations, structural and functional evaluation, an
  LLM-as-a-judge evaluation, and the analysis of an expert, student and
  pattern-author evaluation.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ebrahimnorouzi/ODPGen"
keywords:
  - ontology design patterns
  - large language models
  - ontology engineering
  - evaluation
